    {
      "id": "p0118-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Sans and Papyrus are brothers, but which is the older brother and which is the younger brother? The English script leaves this unclear - they're simply brothers. What's more, Toby had intended for the brothers' relationship to remain unclear.",
        "raw": "Sans and Papyrus are brothers, but which is the older brother and which is\nthe younger brother? The English script leaves this unclear - they're simply\nbrothers. What's more, Toby had intended for the brothers' relationship to\nremain unclear.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29301797,
          0.25714286,
          0.87641081,
          0.32381429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29097696,
          0.25642857,
          0.90706682,
          0.32488571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          10,
          11,
          12,
          13
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Sans 和 Papyrus 是兄弟，但谁是哥哥、谁是弟弟？英文剧本没有说清，只知道他们是兄弟。而且 Toby 本来就打算让他们的长幼关系保持模糊。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29332413,
          0.25571429,
          0.90502581,
          0.32738571
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.4521428571428571,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29332413,
          0.25571429,
          0.90502581,
          0.32738571
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0118-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Unfortunately, the brothers' uncertain relationship presented a major translation problem: there are words for \"younger brother\" and \"older brother\" in Japanese, but not for \"brother\" in general. Rather than make a blind guess, the translator consulted with Toby for details. Thus, through the translation process, it was definitively revealed that Sans is the older brother and Papyrus is the younger brother.",
        "raw": "Unfortunately, the brothers' uncertain relationship presented a major\ntranslation problem: there are words for \"younger brother\" and \"older brother\"\nin Japanese, but not for \"brother\" in general. Rather than make a blind guess,\nthe translator consulted with Toby for details. Thus, through the translation\nprocess, it was definitively revealed that Sans is the older brother and Papyrus\nis the younger brother.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29332413,
          0.33857857,
          0.90475027,
          0.44162143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29097696,
          0.33786429,
          0.90706682,
          0.44269286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          14,
          15,
          16,
          17,
          18,
          19
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "可惜，这种模糊关系造成了一个很大的翻译难题：日语有“弟弟”和“哥哥”的说法，却没有泛指单个“brother”的词。译者没有盲猜，而是向 Toby 询问详情。于是，通过翻译过程，Sans 是哥哥、Papyrus 是弟弟这件事才被明确揭晓。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
