      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "The English script simply says \"sister\" here, while the Japanese script uses the word ねえさん (nēsan, \"older sister\").",
        "raw": "The English script •\nsimply says \"sister\"\nhere, while the\nJapanese script uses the\nword tJ.;{_\n(nesan,\n~A,\n\"older sister\")",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
